<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on BG Plc.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on BG Plc.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 10 million European-style call warrants, on BG Plc, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one BG Plc share.  In the event the demerger does not occur, one warrant controls 0.784 British Gas share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1.00 GBP		  ISSUE PRICE *0.80 GBP</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   05.MAY.97		 PAYDATE	14.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT ONE</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  BRITISH GAS @ 2.29 GBP</p>
<p> NOTES	    *BASED ON 78.4 PCT OF BRITISH GAS LESS 1.00 GBP</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
